# Phase 9 §6/§20: production build uses SAME-ORIGIN requests — left empty
# deliberately (see src/api/client.ts). The browser calls /api/v1/... on
# whatever origin actually served this page (the reverse proxy), which then
# forwards to the FastAPI container over the internal Docker network. Never
# set this to a backend URL/port in production — that would require exposing
# FastAPI directly to the Internet, which Phase 9's architecture avoids.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
